# NestJS services

- `api-gateway`: só proxy HTTP; encaminha `Idempotency-Key`
- Trip: catálogo + projeção de assentos via eventos `seat.*`
- Booking: dono de Reservation; hold 10 min; confirma em `payment.approved`
- Payment: dono de Payment; mock gateway externo; publica `payment.approved`
- Prisma clients: `@bus/trip-prisma`, `@bus/booking-prisma`, `@bus/payment-prisma`
- OTEL → `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` (Grafana LGTM); `/metrics` Prometheus
